    ],
    "text": "By the Order No. 79 of 18th March, 2014 made under the Proviso(a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) andpublished in the Gasette Extraordinary No. 1856/13 dated 01.04.2014was vested in the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. Butthe possession of the said land has not yet been taken for and onbehalf of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. ThereforeI, Wejesundara Mudiyanselage Thilakararathne Bandara Ekanayake,Acting Minister of Lands, by virtue of powers vested in me underSection 39(1) of the Land Acquisition Act, do hereby revoke theOrder No. 79 of 2014 dated 18.03.2014 published in the GazetteExtraordinary No. 1856/13 dated 01.04.2014.",
